     C*
     C*
     C     KEY1130       CHAIN     MCRPMM1130                         66
     C                   IF        NOT%found(MCFPMM1130)
     C                   MOVE      CHKKEY        CNTDATE
     C                   MOVE      CHKZONE       CNTZONE
