     C                   Z-ADD     0             SFTRECD3
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SFTSCHD3
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SFTSRTR3
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SFTCOMP3
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SFTSRTRA3
     C                   Z-ADD     0             SFTCOMPA3
     C                   MOVE      CTSHIFT3RD    SFTSHIFT3
     C                   MOVE      CTCREW3RD     SFTCREW3
